  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fe y Alegria:  Solid Roots of Peace project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Sisters of Saint Clare will work through Fe y Alegria on a project which will promote human development and contribute to the reduction of violence and establishment of a peaceful society by means of strengthening family bonds and the provision of appropriate training in life skills, sports and the Arts in a marginalised area on the outskirts of San Salvador.</narrative>
  </description>
